1402..1478 Comment "/// The presented integers as a model of the shape: `base` zero, a value, as"
1479..1556 Comment "/// the theory\'s `base : Pt` is a constant; `turn` the successor and `unturn`"
1557..1634 Comment "/// the predecessor. Each law is proved by `here`: conversion reads the inner"
